    "detailed_description": "FRAYED is a free survival horror game set on a rural corn farm in the early 20th century. You play as George, a farmer who wakes up in a tool shed with no memories of how he got there. <br>Your task is to complete the ritual and end the curse.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/f1b7efe2e9b6d31c46aa004add5973d6.poster.avif?t=1712957142\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/f1b7efe2e9b6d31c46aa004add5973d6.webm?t=1712957142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Traverse the corn</strong><br>Explore the farm and try not to get lost among the tall corn stalks. Watch your back and avoid loud noises. Something might find you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/80b3aa83ed9d21eddaa4499bbb38d8f9.poster.avif?t=1712957142\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/80b3aa83ed9d21eddaa4499bbb38d8f9.webm?t=1712957142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>A tangible world</strong><br>Grab, throw, pull, push, turn. A tangible world of objects and puzzles are waiting for you to solve them.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/55b216beb9150d918de526eaf02d6531.poster.avif?t=1712957142\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860510/extras/55b216beb9150d918de526eaf02d6531.webm?t=1712957142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Uncover the mystery</strong><br>Read notes and investigate environmental details. What happened on the farm? Where is your brother William? The clues are there. Will you find them?<br><br> <br>Gameplay of 1-2 hours. Contains a Normal and Hardcore mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developers</h2>Dream Jam Games are a small party of danish hobbyist game developers participating in occasional game jams whenever possible.<br>Our games each seek to deliver a joyous experience delivered in small packages.",
